s `replacement=1` in both.\n- Guard-page test proving neither implementation reads past the NUL terminator on truncated sequences (mechanism validated to genuinely SIGSEGV).\n\n## Two things worth flagging\n\n1. **Both test failures I hit were bugs in my harness, not the translation** — parallel tests were recompiling the aux binary while another test exec'd it, which silently dropped `LD_PRELOAD` and faked a divergence. Serialized via `OnceLock`.\n2. **Mutation-tested the suite** to prove it isn't vacuous: 10 deliberate bugs injected into `src/lib.rs` (boundary off-by-ones, `EF BF BD` → `EF BF BE`, dropped NUL terminator, `strdup` path → `malloc` path, `repl < 3` → `< 2`) — **all 10 killed**. `src/lib.rs` was restored byte-identical afterwards.\n\nArtifacts: `translation/{SYMBOLS,ERRORS,CONFIGS}.md`, tests in `translation/tests/`, Phase D automation in `translation/tests/check_features.sh`. `c_src/` untouched apart from the `build/` directory. Note `cargo` needs `--offline` here (crates.io is proxy-blocked; `libloading 0.8.9` was in the local cache)."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":517,"cache_read_input_tokens":98082,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":517,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"60867e95-2696-4f33-80d9-2f09daa96601","uuid":"fa49af7c-03a6-40da-a096-40a237c458ab","timestamp":"2026-09-05T12:54:58.464Z"}
